### 07 - Get Current User Profile
# Requires valid access token
GET {{$dotenv authBaseUrl}}/me
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv accessToken}}

###

### 08 - Update Profile
# Update timezone and notification preferences
PATCH {{$dotenv authBaseUrl}}/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "timezone": "America/New_York",
  "email_notifications": false
}

###

### 09 - Upload Avatar
# Select file when running (VS Code will prompt)
POST {{$dotenv authBaseUrl}}/profile/avatar
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv accessToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data

###

### 10 - Delete Avatar
# Remove avatar from profile
DELETE {{$dotenv authBaseUrl}}/profile/avatar
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv accessToken}}

###

### 11 - Verify Logout (Should Fail After Logout)
# Run this AFTER logout to confirm token is invalidated
GET {{$dotenv authBaseUrl}}/me
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv accessToken}}

###
